By creating an arcane link with your minion army you are able to redirect parts of any damage affecting you to them.

Anytime you take damage [20%, 27%, 32%, 37%, 40% (TL1-5; SP 100)] of it is instead redirected to a random minion within your aura of undeath.

The minion takes 300% damage from that effect.

The damage redirected percent depends on your Spellpower.
